        "text": "=🎯 *Meeting Intelligence Summary*\n\n*Attendees:* {{ $('Analyze Meeting Content Agent').first().json.output.attendees.map(a => a.name).join(', ') }}\n*Topics:* {{ $('Analyze Meeting Content Agent').first().json.output.topics.join(', ') }}\n*Action Items:* {{ $('Format Action Items Agent').first().json.output.actionItems.length }} tasks created\n*Sentiment:* {{ $('Analyze Meeting Content Agent').first().json.output.sentiment }}\n\n📄 Full notes saved to Google Docs\n✉️ Follow-up emails drafted for all attendees",
